Want to personalize your Beat22 account with your own profile photo? It’s super easy and takes just a few seconds! Follow this step-by-step guide to update your profile picture:

## **Step-by-Step: Update your profile picture**

1.  **Log in to Your Account** Go to [beat22.com](https://beat22.com) and sign in.
2.  **Click on your profile icon (Top right corner)** Once logged in, you’ll see your profile icon at the top-right of the screen. Click on it to open the menu.
    
    ![Click on your profile icon (Top right corner) Once logged in, you’ll see your profile icon at the top-right](/images/2025/07/Screenshot-2025-07-01-184159.png)
    
3.  **Go to “Settings”** From the dropdown, select **“Settings”** to open your account settings.
    
    ![Go to “Settings” From the dropdown, select “Settings” to open your account settings.](/images/2025/07/Screenshot-2025-07-01-184217.png)
    
4.  **Click on the profile picture area** You’ll see your current profile photo (or a placeholder image). Click on it.
    
    ![Click on the profile picture area You’ll see your current profile photo (or a placeholder image). Click on it.](/images/2025/07/Screenshot-2025-07-01-184230.png)
    
5.  **Upload a new picture** Select a photo from your device and upload it. Make sure the image is clear and appropriate.
6.  **Save changes** Once uploaded, your profile picture will update automatically. You’re all set!

**You can update it anytime** Want to change your photo again later? Just repeat the steps above.
